 * Resolves a tie for fewest votes among `tied` by comparing their counts
 * across `history` from the first round onwards, narrowing to whoever had
 * the fewest at the first round where they were not all equal, and
 * repeating from the first round again until no round separates the
 * survivors. Returns the one to eliminate, picking by name (sorting last by
 * code point) when history never separates them.
